<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <style>
    .ads-empty { max-width: 560px; text-align: center; padding: 34px 18px !important; }
    .ads-empty-icon { width: 48px; height: 48px; margin: 0 auto 10px; border-radius: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: var(--s-primary-50); color: var(--s-primary); }
    .ads-empty h2 { margin: 0 0 4px !important; font-size: 16px; }
    .ads-empty p { margin: 0 auto 14px; color: var(--s-muted); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.5; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="header">
      <div><h1>Iklan</h1></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card ads-empty">
      <div class="ads-empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="6" y="3" width="12" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M10.5 9.5v5l4-2.5z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h2>Iklan untuk paket Plus dan Basic</h2>
      <p>Permintaan iklan tersedia bagi pemilik mesin paket Plus atau Basic. Hubungi Samakan bila ingin memasang iklan.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/merchant">Kembali ke dashboard</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
